+            "{}: reading cached {} logical {} channel {} pos {} length {} (details: {})",
+            fileInfo.physicalName(),
+            cached,
+            logicalPos,
+            channelPos,
+            relativePos,
+            length,
+            frozenCacheFile
+        );
